SUMMARY:LEGO Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge 11385 - Part 3
DESCRIPTION:Our voyage aboard the Enterprise continues as we return for
 Part 3 of this enormous LEGO build. Expect more bricks, plenty of Star
 Trek conversation, and the continued hunt for whichever tiny grey piece
 inevitably disappears five seconds after we need it. Join me on camera for
 a very special LEGO build celebrating the 60th anniversary of Star Trek!
 We'll be building the LEGO Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701 Bridge
 set 11385 together, bringing one of science fiction's most iconic
 locations to life brick by brick. Settle in for a relaxed build as we
 explore the set, chat about Star Trek, and see the legendary bridge of the
 original Enterprise gradually take shape. Live long and prosper!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6n8FDfWu_8
CATEGORIES:Lego And Brickbuilding
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
