UID:stream-24502211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260822T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260913T005500Z
DTSTART:20260912T203000Z
DTEND:20260912T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 1 - I Was Just
 Trying to Serve My Sentence
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new adventure begins! We're stepping into The Elder
 Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered and returning to Cyrodiil for quests,
 dungeons, exploration, strange characters, questionable character-building
 decisions, and the inevitable distraction caused by something completely
 unrelated to the main quest. Return to the province of Cyrodiil in a
 remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain
 and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create our
 character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions,
 delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon.
 Whether we follow the main story or get completely distracted by side
 quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8euy3YfANII
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
