SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 81 - Labyrinth (1986)
DESCRIPTION:We wrap up another busy week with Jim Henson's fantasy classic
 Labyrinth. Grab your snacks, settle in with the community, and prepare for
 goblins, puzzles, unforgettable music, David Bowie, and an entirely
 reasonable number of extremely tight trousers. Meet you all on Discord for
 Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
