SUMMARY:Cat Me If You Can | Ep. 1
DESCRIPTION: Grab the camera and get ready for a cosy hunt for cats!
 Explore beautifully handcrafted black-and-white comic-style 3D worlds,
 searching every corner for hundreds of cleverly hidden feline friends.
 Photograph the cats you discover to bring colour back into the world,
 while solving puzzles, decoding clues and finding secret pathways along
 the way. With locations inspired by Ancient Egypt, modern Japan and
 medieval castles, this looks like the perfect game for slowing down,
 exploring and seeing just how many cats we can find.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Cat Me If You Can
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
